WEBVTT

00:13:59.958 --> 00:14:05.393
The new economics must and can insist

00:14:05.417 --> 00:14:07.143
that the purpose of the corporation

00:14:07.167 --> 00:14:10.059
is to improve the welfare
of all stakeholders:

00:14:10.083 --> 00:14:12.309
customers, workers,

00:14:12.333 --> 00:14:14.417
community and shareholders alike.

00:14:16.208 --> 00:14:18.226
Rule four:

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.458
greed is not good.

00:14:22.583 --> 00:14:26.351
Being rapacious
doesn't make you a capitalist,

00:14:26.375 --> 00:14:28.434
it makes you a sociopath.

00:14:28.458 --> 00:14:30.893
(Laughter)